<title>MEXICO: ICA Pasha in transportation joint venture.</title>
<headline>ICA Pasha in transportation joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican construction firm Empresas ICA and U.S.-based transportation firm Pasha Group are to launch a joint venture, ICA-Pasha SA de CV, to transport auto products from manufacturers to markets, ICA said in a news release on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The privatization of ports, terminals and rail lines will make for significant improvements in transportation. ICA-Pasha seeks to raise quality in this area,&quot; the news release said.</p>
<p>-- Daniel Perez-Whitaker, Monterrey bureau +528 345-7617</p>
</text>
